      "rule": "R19",
      "severity": "should",
      "text": "The status claims that a check certifies at most two witnesses, but `check` certifies candidates before replay and continues after replay failures, so even screened checks can exceed this bound. Fix: state that screened shrinking adds at most one certification after a replayable witness is found, and correct the matching `check` docstring."
